      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This collection is comprised of 390 patients who presented with vestibular schwannoma (VS, n=73), trigeminal neuralgia (TGN, n=119) or metastatic disease (M, n=198, 4-26 metastases) and were subsequently treated with Gamma Knife (Elekta AB, Stockholm, Sweden) stereotactic radiosurgery. For each patient, the treatment indication is designated with a suffix on their patient ID (VS, TGN or M).",
          "descriptionType": "Abstract",
          "lang": null
